== Effects ==
* Grants 5 {{e|Bomb}}s.
* Grants homing bombs.

== Notes ==
* This item can make bombing out of rooms difficult, as the bombs may slide towards enemies and away from the door.

== Synergies ==
* {{i|Dr. Fetus}}: The bombs that Isaac fires will be homing.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|Doctor's Remote}}/{{i|Epic Fetus}}: Crosshair will not home in on enemies.
* {{i|Bob's Rotten Head}}: No effect.

